Z||000012||Jaygee79||07-25-2001||11:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>Wow, I had the right back on my yellow 88GT smoking on the way home from Kick Hill too. We stopped for gas and Jaygee was driving it. When we started back up she must have not released the ebrake all the way and it started smoking. We pulled over and I Jacked up the wheel. I could spin it fine after releasing the e-brake.<P>I am glad that you didn't have a lot of damage or a huge fire   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sure, blame it on me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  It would help if the brake light worked.<P>------------------<BR>Jaime<BR>84SE red<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooh14.jpg"> ||||reg||1
