Z||000014||SilverFieroV6||07-26-2001||03:15 AM||||Well I didnt get my car today.  It was ready but I worked all day as I stayed to cover the second shift as the kid who was supposed to work asked me to stay so he could go out to the bar.  I figured its his 21st b-day,  it only comes once and I can wait till the morning to get my car.  <P>Hey 88coupe I tried that route but ended up doing more dammage to my 85se then i did actually fixing it.  I tried replaceing the head gasket, it was completed in just under 10 months.  I had alot of problems, and most of the secondary work ( I had gotten it all back together but the car wouldnt start) to get it running was done by 3gen camaro/ firebird owners.    So when I got the gold se I said that I wouldnt do any major work to the car myself.  I know brakes on the car can be a little dificult with the e-brake and all so I said let someone else do it and if it goes wrong he can fix it till its right, unfortunatley that thought bit me in the a$$.  <P>Bill it was nice meeting you and the rest of the people at the swap meet.  I had a really good time up there, and was glad that I decided to go to my first fiero show.  Its unfortunate that I wont be able to make it to Va, as it looks to be a good time.  By the time I really started thinking about going I realized that I cant get the time off work and dont really have the money.  Hopefully next year i'll make it down there, and I should still  make a few shows in the nh/mass area in late aug/early sept as I will be back up in Nashua NH for college.<BR>Sam<P>------------------<BR>Gold 86 SE V6 4sp daily driver<BR>Silver 85 SE V6 auto ( actually running now)||||reg||1
Z||000015||tgowens||07-26-2001||05:50 AM||||SilverFieroV6, glad that you are alright. You really should use the e-brake every time you park though as that is the adjustment for the rear brakes.......<P>88CoupeV6, just pushing the e-brake handle down doesn't release the e-brake........pull up, push the button to unlatch it, then push the handle down........<P>Jaygee79, good idea, keep after him to fix that light!!||||reg||1
